      "structure_description": "A cage-like cluster approximately 2.2 nm in diameter has a central YbO6 trigonal prism enclosed by a Cu18Cl3 inner shell and a Cu36 outer cage. The Cu18Cl3 shell comprises two twisted bowl-shaped Cu9 fragments linked by three chloride ions and Cu–Cu contacts. The outer Cu36 cage comprises two crown-like Cu9 units joined by three Cu6 units, and 36 alkynyl ligands protect the metal core."
